{"id": "finqa_dev_413", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "As of December 31, 2010, what percentage of the net allowance did Citigroup's purchased distressed loan portfolio represent in relation to its carrying amount, which was $392 million?", "program_answer": 0.19642857142857142, "original_answer": "19.6%", "company_cik": 831001, "report_year": 2010, "gold_chunk_ids": [200], "final_answer": "Based on the provided evidence:\n\n* As of December 31, 2010, the carrying amount of Citigroup's purchased distressed loan portfolio was **$392 million**, which was net of an allowance of **$77 million** (against a gross carrying amount of loan receivable of $469 million).\n* In relation to the net carrying amount of $392 million, the allowance of $77 million represents approximately **19.64%** ($\\frac{\\$77\\text{ million}}{\\$392\\text{ million}} \\times 100$). \n*(In relation to the gross carrying amount of $469 million, it represents approximately **16.42%**).*", "iterations": 1, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Citigroup December 31 2010 purchased distressed loans carrying amount 392 million allowance", "rerank_query": "December 31 2010 purchased distressed loans carrying amount 392 million allowance", "tickers": ["C"], "judge_verdict": "finish", "top_k": [["C_2010_831001", 200, 0.9987289309501648], ["C_2010_831001", 65, 0.9307921528816223], ["C_2009_831001", 70, 0.8768824934959412], ["C_2015_831001", 214, 0.8272470831871033], ["C_2009_831001", 196, 0.7206701636314392], ["C_2008_831001", 200, 0.6445034146308899], ["C_2018_831001", 74, 0.6432045102119446], ["C_2010_831001", 63, 0.6347708106040955], ["C_2017_831001", 85, 0.6239432692527771], ["C_2009_831001", 71, 0.5899140238761902]], "candidates_prerank": [["C_2010_831001", 200], ["C_2010_831001", 65], ["C_2008_831001", 200], ["C_2009_831001", 196], ["C_2010_831001", 197], ["C_2016_831001", 88], ["C_2010_831001", 123], ["C_2015_831001"