{"id": "finqa_dev_478", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What is the percentage change in the balance of the Prudential Insurance Company of America from 2016 to 2017, as reflected in the estimated cost to replace all such annuities for which Everest Re Group, Ltd. was contingently liable?", "program_answer": -0.012893581876633881, "original_answer": "-1.3%", "company_cik": 1095073, "report_year": 2017, "gold_chunk_ids": [149], "final_answer": "Based on the provided evidence, the estimated cost to replace annuities from The Prudential Insurance Company of America for which Everest Re Group, Ltd. was contingently liable was:\n\n* **2016:** $146,507 thousand\n* **2017:** $144,618 thousand\n\n### **Calculation:**\n$$\\text{Percentage Change} = \\frac{144,618 - 146,507}{146,507} \\times 100 = \\frac{-1,889}{146,507} \\times 100 \\approx -1.29\\%$$\n\nThe balance decreased by **$1,889 thousand**, representing a **decrease of approximately 1.29%** (or **-1.29%**) from 2016 to 2017.", "iterations": 1, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Everest Re Group Prudential Insurance Company of America annuities contingently liable 2016 2017", "rerank_query": "Prudential Insurance Company of America annuities contingently liable 2016 2017", "tickers": ["RE"], "judge_verdict": "finish", "top_k": [["RE_2017_1095073", 149, 0.9925656318664551], ["RE_2016_1095073", 141, 0.976072371006012], ["RE_2018_1095073", 157, 0.9661509990692139], ["RE_2015_1095073", 135, 0.9569889307022095], ["RE_2014_1095073", 131, 0.9399657845497131], ["RE_2017_1095073", 2, 0.9049600958824158], ["RE_2013_1095073", 130, 0.8983086943626404], ["RE_2010_1095073", 131, 0.8884367346763611], ["RE_2012_1095073", 134, 0.8770028948783875], ["RE_2007_1095073", 129, 0.8592063188552856]], "candidates_prerank": [["RE_2012_1095073", 134], ["RE_2006_1095073", 131], ["RE_2013_1095073", 130], ["RE_2017_1095073", 149], ["RE_2010_1095073", 131], ["R