{"id": "finqa_dev_609", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What would Union Pacific Corporation's 2014 capital expenditures have been, in millions, if they hadn't included the early buyout of the operating lease of their headquarters?", "program_answer": 4510.0, "original_answer": "4510", "company_cik": 100885, "report_year": 2014, "gold_chunk_ids": [18, 29], "final_answer": "Based on the provided reports:\n\n* **Total cash capital investments (capital expenditures) in 2014:** $4,346 million\n* **Early buyout of the headquarters building operating lease:** $261 million\n\nSubtracting the buyout amount:\n$$\\$4,346\\text{ million} - \\$261\\text{ million} = \\$4,085\\text{ million}$$\n\nUnion Pacific Corporation's 2014 capital expenditures would have been **$4,085 million** without the early buyout of their headquarters operating lease.", "iterations": 1, "hit_iteration_cap": false, "judge_verdicts": ["finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Union Pacific 2014 capital expenditures early buyout operating lease headquarters", "rerank_query": "2014 capital expenditures early buyout operating lease headquarters", "tickers": ["UNP"], "judge_verdict": "finish", "top_k": [["UNP_2015_100885", 29, 0.985481321811676], ["UNP_2016_100885", 29, 0.9232091307640076], ["UNP_2014_100885", 29, 0.91508549451828], ["UNP_2012_100885", 67, 0.0840633362531662], ["UNP_2013_100885", 67, 0.07844158262014389], ["UNP_2011_100885", 71, 0.05705887824296951], ["UNP_2016_100885", 55, 0.03676171600818634], ["UNP_2015_100885", 58, 0.03409126400947571], ["UNP_2014_100885", 33, 0.03054957464337349], ["UNP_2014_100885", 2, 0.024222515523433685]], "candidates_prerank": [["UNP_2015_100885", 29], ["UNP_2014_100885", 2], ["UNP_2007_100885", 48], ["UNP_2009_100885", 70], ["UNP_2007_100885", 59], ["UNP_2014_100885", 42], ["UNP_2008_100885", 66], ["UNP_2011_100885", 4], ["UNP_2009_100885", 3], ["UNP_2013_100885", 2], ["UNP_2015_100885", 44], ["UNP_2010_100885", 3], ["UNP_2006_10