{"id": "finqa_dev_168", "split": "dev", "subset_source": "FinQA", "question": "What is the total amount of net tangible assets acquired by Global Payments, as disclosed in the 2017 Form 10-K annual report?", "program_answer": 62154.0, "original_answer": "$ 62154", "company_cik": 1123360, "report_year": 2017, "gold_chunk_ids": [76], "final_answer": "Based on Note 2 (*Acquisitions*) of Global Payments\u2019 2017 Form 10-K, the purchase price allocation for the acquisition of **ACTIVE Network** (completed September 1, 2017) discloses the following provisional fair values as of December 31, 2017:\n\n### **Assets Acquired and Liabilities Assumed (in thousands):**\n* **Cash and cash equivalents:** $42,913\n* **Property and equipment:** $21,985\n* **Other assets:** $87,240\n* **Deferred income taxes:** $(31,643)\n* **Other liabilities:** $(144,132)\n* **Identified intangible assets:** $410,545\n---\n* **Total identifiable net assets:** **$386,908**\n* **Goodwill:** $784,668\n* **Total purchase consideration:** $1,171,576\n\n---\n\n### **Net Tangible Assets Calculation:**\nWhile \"net tangible assets\" is not listed as a standalone line item, it can be determined by subtracting identified intangible assets from total identifiable net assets (or by summing the tangible assets and liabilities):\n\n$$\\text{Net Tangible Assets} = \\$386,908 - \\$410,545 = -\\$23,637\\text{ thousand (or a net tangible liability of }\\$23,637,000\\text{)}$$\n\n*(At the preliminary September 30, 2017 measurement date prior to measurement-period adjustments, total identifiable net assets were $467,556 thousand with $471,120 thousand in intangible assets, representing $-\\$3,564$ thousand in net tangible assets).*", "iterations": 4, "hit_iteration_cap": true, "judge_verdicts": ["loop", "loop", "loop", "finish"], "trajectory": [{"iteration": 1, "query": "Global Payments 2017 Form 10-K net tangible assets acquired", "rerank_query": "2017 net tangible assets acquired", "tickers": ["GPN"], "judge_verdi